1
00:00:00,668 --> 00:00:02,138
(Stuart:)I'm jealous.

2
00:00:02,136 --> 00:00:03,736
(Stuart:)Closest I've come
to dating two women

3
00:00:03,738 --> 00:00:06,338
(Stuart:)was that time I dated one woman.

4
00:00:10,211 --> 00:00:12,441
(Leonard:)I don't know how
you put up with it.

5
00:00:12,447 --> 00:00:14,447
(Leonard:)He's impossible.
I mean, holding a meeting

6
00:00:14,449 --> 00:00:17,279
(Leonard:)to decide what
breakfast cereal we should buy.

7
00:00:17,285 --> 00:00:20,985
(Howard:)Yeah. Cap'n Crunch
with Crunch Berries, move on.

8
00:00:20,988 --> 00:00:24,888
(Leonard:)Anyway, Amy, thank you
for sticking up for me.

9
00:00:24,892 --> 00:00:28,262
(Amy:)Oh, I honestly
couldn't care less.

10
00:00:28,262 --> 00:00:29,992
(Leonard:)Sorry?

11
00:00:29,997 --> 00:00:32,297
(Amy:)Well, I just took your side
'cause sometimes I get annoyed

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,870
(Amy:)at how close Sheldon
and Penny are.

13
00:00:33,868 --> 00:00:36,868
(Leonard:)Well, they argue all the time.

14
00:00:36,871 --> 00:00:38,101
(Leonard:)They aren't that close.

15
00:00:38,106 --> 00:00:40,276
(Amy:)Who's always comforting
him when he's upset?

16
00:00:40,274 --> 00:00:42,444
(Leonard:)Penny, but...
Who's the only one

17
00:00:42,443 --> 00:00:44,213
(Amy:)who can make him take his
medicine when he's sick?

18
00:00:44,212 --> 00:00:46,182
(Leonard:)I try to hide it
in his peanut butter,

19
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:48,050
(Leonard:)but he spits it out.

20
00:00:49,851 --> 00:00:50,851
(Raj:)Okay.

21
00:00:50,852 --> 00:00:52,752
(Amy:)And did you know she
has him add things

22
00:00:52,754 --> 00:00:54,984
(Sheldon:)to the Roommate Agreement
so she can get her way

23
00:00:54,989 --> 00:00:56,989
(Amy:)and not fight
with you about it?

24
00:00:56,991 --> 00:01:01,021
(Leonard:)Son of a bitch.

